{#
   The League System (#leagues). The tier-payment table and the pyramid both
   come from the League table rather than from copy — this section once claimed a
   flat "22 clubs" for all eight tiers, which is why neither number is written
   down here.

   Changed in the redesign:
     - the matchday GIF (images/match-ticker.gif) is gone. It is a capture of the
       app, which the design rules out alongside the screenshots, and it was the
       page's single largest asset. Its copy point — live 1x/2x/4x matchday
       ticker — now sits in the prose, where it costs nothing to load.
     - a decorative kits-and-players scene takes its place.

   The pyramid list is NOT in the design, which shows the payment table and one
   scene. It is kept because it is live League data and the only place the page
   shows the shape of the ladder; it sits beside the table in the same column
   block so the designed two-column split still reads as drawn.

   Tiers with no prize/TV value configured are omitted from the table rather
   than rendered as £0, which would read as a deliberate figure.
#}
{% set country_names = world.countries|map(c => c.name) %}
{% set funded = world.tiers|filter(t => t.prizeMoney is not null or t.tvDeal is not null) %}

<section class="leagues-section" id="leagues" aria-labelledby="lg-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">The League System</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="lg-title">{{ world.totals.tierCount }} TIERS. {{ world.totals.npcClubs|number_format }} CLUBS. ONE ASCENT.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Start in non-league obscurity at the bottom of the pyramid, playing everyone home and away. Rival clubs have fully simulated squads, staff, finances and tactics, so beating them means building something real. Track live match updates on the 2D matchday pitch at 1x, 2x or 4x speed, or skip straight to the result.</p>

        <div class="leagues-split">
            <div class="leagues-data">
                {% if funded is not empty %}
                    <div class="prize-table-wrap dash-scroll">
                        <table class="prize-table">
                            <caption class="pixel">WHAT EACH TIER PAYS</caption>
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th scope="col">Tier</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Division</th>
                                    <th scope="col" class="num">Prize money</th>
                                    <th scope="col" class="num">TV deal</th>
                                    <th scope="col" class="num">Position pot</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                {% for tier in funded %}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="is-cyan">T{{ tier.tier }}</td>
                                        <td>{{ tier.name }}</td>
                                        <td class="num">{{ tier.prizeMoney is null ? '—' : '£' ~ tier.prizeMoney|number_format }}</td>
                                        <td class="num">{{ tier.tvDeal is null ? '—' : '£' ~ tier.tvDeal|number_format }}</td>
                                        <td class="num">{{ tier.leaguePositionPot is null ? '—' : '£' ~ tier.leaguePositionPot|number_format }}</td>
                                    </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <p class="prize-note">Season-end payouts. Climb a tier and the money changes shape entirely.</p>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}

                <div class="pyramid-wrap" role="list" aria-label="League pyramid tiers">
                    {% for tier in world.tiers %}
                        <div class="pyramid-tier t{{ tier.tier }}" role="listitem">
                            <span class="pyramid-tier-name">
                                TIER {{ tier.tier }}{% if loop.first %} — ELITE{% elseif loop.last %} — YOUR START{% endif %}
                            </span>
                            <span class="pyramid-tier-clubs">{{ tier.clubs }} clubs</span>
                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
                <p class="pyramid-label">
                    {{ world.totals.npcClubs|number_format }} NPC clubs ·
                    {{ country_names|join(', ') }}{% if world.totals.playableCountries == 1 %} only{% endif %} · more countries coming
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="leagues-scene">
                <div class="scene" data-scene="match">
                    <img alt="Home and away kits above three pixel players" width="520" height="400" decoding="async">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
